sequenceDiagram
    title BLE Central Discovery and Connection Example: Pulse Oximeter

    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]
    participant Peripheral as Pulse Oximeter<br>BLE Peripheral

    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through<br>Echo callbacks (e.g. CurrentState).

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Startup / readiness
        App->>Node: GapCentral.GetState()
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Discovery
        App->>Node: GapCentral.SetDeviceDiscoveryFilter(filter=none)
        Note right of App: DeviceDiscoveryFilter only supports address / manufacturerSpecificData.<br>Name filtering ("Nonin3150") is applied App-side after DeviceDiscovered.
        App->>Node: GapCentral.StartDeviceDiscovery()
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(scanning)

        Peripheral-)Node: Advertisement
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.DeviceDiscovered(<br>addressWithType={address=C4:AB:12:34:56:78, addressType=randomAddress},<br>data=0x0A 0x09 'N''o''n''i''n''3''1''5''0' 0x03 0x03 0x22 0x18,<br>rssi=-42, advertisingReportType=advInd)

        note over App: Device name matches "Nonin3150".<br>Address type is random (may be a resolvable private address).
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Stop scanning before connecting
        App->>Node: GapCentral.Standby()
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Connect
        App->>Node: GapCentral.Connect(<br>addressWithType={address=C4:AB:12:34:56:78, addressType=randomAddress},<br>initiatingTimeoutInMs=5000)
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(initiating)

        Node-)Peripheral: CONNECT_IND (unacknowledged)
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Note over Node, Peripheral: Typical first LL activity after CONNECT_IND
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_FEATURE_REQ
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_FEATURE_RSP
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_VERSION_IND
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_VERSION_IND
            Note over Node, Peripheral: Empty data PDUs (M -> S and S -> M) establish<br>the first bidirectional connection event.
        end
        Note over Node, Peripheral: Central assumes the connection has started once CONNECT_IND is sent.<br>Link is confirmed by the first bidirectional data exchange<br>in a connection event.
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(connected)

        note over App: Connection established.<br>Proceed with GATT service discovery.
    end
